When you click “Mark as Paid,” the system runs a short chain that updates the database and then forces the cards to recalc:

UI handler – 
DashboardMain.mark_as_paid()
 (@ui/dashboard_main.py#1728-1747)
Calls core.commitment_manager.mark_commitment_paid_manually(user_id, commitment_id).
Reloads the commitments grid and immediately triggers:
refresh_dashboard()
 (which reruns the dashboard sections),
refresh_metrics_cards_main()
 and 
metrics_carousel.refresh_metrics_cards()
 (so the “Price After Commitments” card rebuilds).
Runs check_commitments(user_id) to refresh reminders.
