Implemented the new event-driven “instant update” flow:

CommitmentForm
Added a commitment_added signal (with logging) that fires as soon as the user saves a commitment, emitting the amount so listeners can update immediately.
CommitmentTrackerWidget
When it opens CommitmentForm (regular or savings), it now connects that signal and forwards the delta to its parent dashboard via 
handle_commitment_added_signal
.
